WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Innovation rarely arrives all at once.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
It grows in shared rooms, in labs, in workshops, and in conversations.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.500
How do we make the tool work when connectivity is unstable and the screen is small?

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Simplify the path, lower the barriers, and let the user keep moving.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.500
If the interface asks too much of the audience, it is asking the wrong questions.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Access is not the final layer. It is part of how the story gets told.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.000
That mindset turns innovation into something shareable and human.
